    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Here we see a slaughterhouse. Scenes like this were recorded by the Egyptians
    into hieroglyphs and wooden models, then placed into tombs. \n\nThe Egyptians
    believed that doing so would allow these workers to follow the buried person
    into the afterlife and continue their work for them.\n\n"
