    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "The pyramids were originally coated in perfectly carved white limestone,
    and mounted with a gold plated capstone.\n\n Over time, the limestone broke away
    and robbers stole the gold from the original pyramid, leaving only the plain
    sandstone structures that we know today."
