    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Although the way we see Egyptian ruins now are old and grandiose sandstone
    structures devoid of color, almost all Egyptian statues and temples and palaces
    were painted in vivid colors. \n\nThe most striking example is the famous Sphinx
    of egypt: which was originally painted blue and gold. "
