    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "The egpytians relied on simple engineering techniques to build the Pyramids.
    \n\nThey used levels like the one in this image to make sure the entire base
    was even, and used trigonometry to evaluate the geometric structure of the pyramids.  "
