    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "In this time, before phones, lightbulbs, or even the industrial revolution,
    the stars would shine this brightly every night. Although light pollution has
    made it harder to see in today\u2019s world, on clear nights the Milky Way will
    occasionally shine as bright as it used to, and you can look up at the exact
    same sky that all the Egyptians, Greeks, and Romans who ever lived slept under. "
