  m_Text: "This is a hieroglyph of butchers working in ancient Egypt. \n\nMuch of
    what we know about the ancient Egyptians comes from these stylized drawings,
    called Hieroglyphs, that were engraved then painted in tombs to be discovered
    thousands of years later."
